          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kidsy is redefining the recommerce industry by leveraging our proprietary technology to drive the fastest sell-through of products better than anyone else in the industry. We are driven by our mission which is rooted in sustainability.</p><p>Through the <strong>Kidsy Collective</strong>, we are proud to showcase some of the leading brands and retailers we work closely with to give customer-returns and excess products a second life. Every day we save these products from ending up in landfills and put them back in the hands of our consumers nationwide.</p>"
